    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.app.about.Intro">Check for updates, try pre-releases, install any version, or go back to the old settings window.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.app.about.updates.Title">Updates</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.app.about.updates.Body">MultiPreview checks GitHub for a new release when it starts, unless you turn that off. **Check for updates** checks right now.&#x0A;&#x0A;**Install a specific version** lists every release. Installing an older one turns off the startup check, so it doesn't offer to update straight back.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.app.about.window.Title">The old settings window</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.app.about.window.Body">The previous settings window stays available for now. Turn on **Use the old settings window**, then reopen settings to use it. In the old window, **Use the new settings window** brings you back. The old window will be removed in a later release.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.app.about.fonts.Title">Fonts</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.app.about.fonts.Body">Some looks draw their text in a typeface of their own. MultiPreview carries these typefaces itself, so nothing is installed on your PC. Each is free under the SIL Open Font License 1.1: **Show the licence** shows its text here.</sys:String>
