    <sys:String x:Key="L.S.Eve.DetectStep1">This finds out which account each character is on, by watching which files EVE writes when you log in.&#x0A;&#x0A;Step 1: log every character out (back to the login screen, or close the clients). Are they all logged out?</sys:String>
