    <sys:String x:Key="L.Start.Newer.Title">A newer settings file was found</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Start.Newer.Body">Your settings file is:&#x0A;{0}&#x0A;last changed {1}.&#x0A;&#x0A;A different settings file was changed after it, on {3}:&#x0A;{2}&#x0A;&#x0A;This happens when an older version of MultiPreview ran from that folder, or a settings file was copied there. Use the newer file? Your current settings are kept in the Backups folder first.</sys:String>
