    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.alerts.hub.historyWindow.Title">The history window</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.alerts.hub.historyWindow.Body">**Open history…** lists the alerts that were kept, newest first, with how long ago each one was. The same window opens from **Alert history…** in the tray menu, and from the hub: right-click the bell, then click the clock in the corner.&#x0A;&#x0A;- Pick a time range, a character, an alert or a severity, or type in the search box. An alert that repeats for one character within ten minutes, with the same text, system and outcome, shows as a single row with a count.&#x0A;- **Switch to client** brings that row's client to the front. Enter on a row and a double-click do the same.&#x0A;- **Export CSV…** writes the alerts shown to a file a spreadsheet can open.&#x0A;- **Clear history…** deletes everything that was kept.&#x0A;&#x0A;The other corner button of the hub's menu closes every toast, as a click on the bell does.</sys:String>
