    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.alerts.events.clientReady.Title">Client ready</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="L.Help.alerts.events.clientReady.Body">**Client ready** tells you a client has reached the game: its window goes from the login screen to a logged-in character. Turn it on in the event table (under Clients); it is off until you do.&#x0A;&#x0A;- It is raised once for each login.&#x0A;- It says nothing for clients that were already logged in when MultiPreview started, for a character switch inside one window, or for a logout.&#x0A;- It is an info event: a steady border and the badge, and a sound if alert sounds are on.</sys:String>
