    <sys:String x:Key="L.S.clients.hotkeys.commandPalette.Desc">Opens a small box over the monitor your mouse is on. Type a few letters of a character, label, group or profile and press Enter to switch to it. Press the key again or Esc to close it. Works like the other hotkeys, while an EVE client is running.</sys:String>
